<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  2.55 %		    C/S =  3.82%</p>
<p>	   O/N =  1.28 %		    O/N =  1.28%</p>
<p>	   T/N =  1.28 %		    T/N =  1.28</p>
<p>		   July 8, 1997		     July 7, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.70 %     1 month forward =  2.72 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.72 %     2 month forward =  2.89 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.06 %     3 month forward =  3.28 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  3.40 %     4 month forward =  3.48 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  3.53 %     5 month forward =  3.60 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  3.57 %     6 month forward =  3.63 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
